{
  "text": " The huddled maskless descended upon Washington for the million mandate march. Thousands of far right-wing nuts joined thousands of far left-wing nuts for what was billed as a defeat the mandates rally at COVID cello where people had nothing totally unprotected and if you're wondering what kind of speakers they lined up for this meeting of the minds the answer is this kind. Freedom of choice means everything. I mean just think about it as an African American male, black American male, you know I understand something about slavery I understand something about bondage. I'm actually a Marine Corps veteran never in my life would I have think that I would be on this soil fighting for my rights for freedom. Freedom of choice is quite simple. You provide the therapeutic or the medical intervention. You give me all of the information from benefit to risk and I make a decision for what's right for me, my body. We do believe in the health and safety of our patients. We do believe that there are other ways to treat COVID and to prevent COVID. We think that those measures have been censored over the past two years. Why we're not hearing two sides of the story. Why we're only listening to one side and if there's another side why are they being censored? Why are they being demonized? I always say if you want to know what's going on follow the money if you want to know what the truth is see who's being silenced. We all know what censorship is about at this point it's not about protecting or preserving life it's about protecting and preserving the narrative. The mandates are not beneficial for anyone. Black, white or in between Muslim Christian Jewish, Democrat, Republican it doesn't matter at this point it is a total all-out attack on humanity itself. It's an attempt to turn the mandates into laws because mandates are not laws so that now if we don't obey the laws which were once illegal mandates now we're subject to the criminal justice system and within that system now we become involuntary servants and so the 13th Amendment no longer applies to us. Your compliance will determine your ability to participate in society. We didn't have any say in the matter you know that we got sent a letter in the mail and said you're not allowed to show up at your firehouse you're allowed to serve your community. It's a pretty self-evident truth that corporations always put profit over people and so I don't know why people think this is different. The pharmaceutical industry literally controls the kind of information that gets to doctors it manipulates doctors the medical journals. They're mandating something that if you get injured they don't know how to cure you. We need to make it clear that it's not acceptable to be forcing people to take an unlicensed medical product without providing them full informed consent. I don't believe the government has any right to inject anything into my body I don't have control over. At some point we have to say enough is enough especially is not working. Why should you have to show your medical status to eat? To enjoy a museum to enjoy a park. You have people here from every political party you have political orientation and they're all finding common ground. The ACR constitutes an under attack on our children under attack.",
